# Write one feedforward vector (firmware CMD_SET_FF_VEC).
#
# The length the firmware expects depends on the item: 7 values for items 1..5, 7 and 8,
# 3 values for the gravity vector (item 6). The SDK rejects a wrong length with
# InvalidCommandError, which the driver returns as this service's message.

int32 item             # see litearm::Arm::ff_vec_items()
float64[] values
---
bool success
string message
